  "description": "The 300 kg small-satellite bus as a 3D model with its equipment mounted: arrays, a star tracker, a dish, a nozzle. The design checks find the +y array in the tracker's view and in the nozzle's plume. One orbit, with the disturbance torques and the arrays' shading recorded.\n\nWhat to look at:\n- Run > Design Checks: the field of view, the plume, the mass budget and the launcher envelope.\n- Results > Model Analyses: the disturbance torques, the momentum and the arrays' shading.\n\nTry changing:\n- The star tracker's tilt to 0 deg (looking level): the array leaves its field of view.\n- The nozzle's plume half-angle to 10 deg: the plume clears the array.",
  "schema_version": 4
